  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shanxi Low-Carbon and Inclusive Rural Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is aligned with the impact that high-quality and green development and carbon
dioxide (CO2) emission peaking before 2030 in Shanxi Province1 and Yellow River Economic
Corridor (YREC) achieved. The project&#x2019;s outcome is low-carbon, climate-resilient,
environmentally sustainable, and socially inclusive public services improved in Shanxi Province.</narrative>
  </description>
